    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -335,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 275,
      "text": "# MDSE software-object composition and function performance\n\nSaved projection of native SysML v2 **part usages** and **perform action** statements in the live notes. Left to right: Toolset, five tools, typed internal software objects, existing reusable functions. Core, Base Vault and Bootstrap subcomponents are intentionally not given unsupported `perform` relationships. Edit the SysML source notes to change meaning, not the Canvas line."
    }
